<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-INDIA 179 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 179 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 179 in 48.3 overs in the first limited overs match against West Indies on Saturday.</p>
</text>
